<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="yellow">Spiracle Lungs</ansi> mutation

Your breathing reorganizes into a lattice of insectile spiracles —
tireless, and indifferent to bad air.

<ansi fg="yellow">Type:</ansi>     Passive
<ansi fg="yellow">Rarity:</ansi>   Uncommon

<ansi fg="yellow">Benefits:</ansi>
  Quickens how fast your stamina returns
  Shrugs off gas, poison, and foul air, and lets you hold your
  breath far longer than any lung should allow

